  "label": "Racial Stereotyping",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Black people are unintelligent or naive, which is used to mock the political views of liberals. This is a form of racial stereotyping and dehumanization, as the visual of a Black child is used to imply that the speaker is 'stupid' or 'uninformed' for believing the political claim. This stereotype is part of a broader history of racial prejudice and is used to make the message more impactful and to belittle the political views of liberals.",
